{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他刚沉进熟悉的安宁里，身体先猛地一紧，才发现现实里还过不上那种生活，懊恼自己竟忘了还有事要面对。\",\n      \"key\": \"身体先猛地一紧\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他当初不肯再等，是怕珍惜的东西继续受损，光怀念也护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯再等\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却怕争取时一味硬撑，耗掉刚找回的温柔，最后只剩意志，连想留住那种生活的心也磨没了。\",\n      \"key\": \"刚找回的温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想清为何不能再等就能安心，如今还得顾虑争取会不会磨掉温柔，理由更多了，心反而更难平静。\",\n      \"key\": \"理由更多\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并压紧\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安宁让他重新看见现实缺口、身体先受惊，以及他懊恼自己忘了还有事要面对；删去对刚沉进满足的重复交代，并让熟悉的亲近与现实落差共同说明失落为何突然变得真切。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"不再先讲不能只靠怀念的一般道理，而是直接写出他当初不肯再等的具体缘由：珍惜的东西还在受损，光怀念护不住它们。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补全\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想重新投入却不能再不顾一切的变化，补回他怕自己硬撑到最后只剩意志、连想留住那种生活的心也被磨掉的后果；删除重复概括两难的R38。原先笼统的失去之怕不再直接连到S07-3，具体担忧改由S05-4的硬撑经历和S06-6重新回来的柔软共同支撑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他原以为想清不肯再等的理由就能安心，却因新增了争取可能磨掉温柔的顾虑而更难平静的变化；不再用拿不准怎么做代替理由增多带来的不安，并保留它与S01最初寻找足够理由的困境之间的改写关系。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这是对音乐材料的另一种辨认，与主体验所依据的听法不同，不必转写成人物的心理经历，也不应强行并入他的行动与依恋冲突。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f102840e-53a2-4cfb-b2c5-18e50cb34c67", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T144935969204Z", "elapsed_seconds": 987.546, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T15:06:03.526183+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d2e1f81359eb3bf30940c680a071be949fe6e0c04690f2d9d5c48bf9a6aff09e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.